            <ArticleTitle>Facial pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>287-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The problems of diagnosis of pain are examined and the more important extra-oral causes which may complicate the diagnosis are discussed. The need for a complete and careful history and the use of thorough examination procedures is stressed in order that intra-oral causes may be eliminated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
